{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It\u2019s the night before <strong>Y2K</strong>, and your dad\u2014<strong>the Devil himself</strong>\u2014has a plan to rule the world. Unfortunately for him, you\u2019ve been <strong>challenged to stop it</strong>. Armed with sarcasm, questionable decision-making, and whatever weird items you can scrounge up, you\u2019ll navigate a cast of <strong>chaotic characters</strong>, each with their own ridiculous problems to solve.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975560/extras/be7d6aa2c607e99227bab1f7daacf6dd.avif?t=1756340022\" width=920 height=430 /></span><br><br><strong>Time is of the essence\u00a0</strong>- Every minute in <strong>real time</strong> is a minute in the game. It's a good thing <strong><i>skateboarding</i></strong> is faster than walking! You start at <strong>8AM</strong> and have until Midnight to <i><strong>save the world...\u00a0</strong></i>but <strong><u>DON'T PANIC</u>!</strong> There are rumors of a time traveler with experimental... &quot;<i>methods</i>&quot; who may be able to help.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975560/extras/e863886aabf57f1b66c42f12047659e1.avif?t=1756340022\" width=1560 height=1166 /></span><br><br><strong>Minimal guiderails</strong> - Coming up with a plan to <i><strong>save the world</strong></i> isn't easy, but through exploring the open world, talking to people, and collecting various items, the path to salvation may start to unfurl before you. But be careful! <strong><i>Your choices matter</i></strong>, choose wisely or you may end up with a <i><strong>fate</strong></i> you deserve...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975560/extras/3c8817b62a01aa1ab17d976d346af9ad.avif?t=1